        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.2.14</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:39:10 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/tag/0.2.14</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Invite friends directly from group settings, with simpler controls for creating, saving, leaving and deleting groups.

Agent activity uses each person's time zone consistently. Day statistics can scroll back through the last 24 hours, and charts wait for pointer movement before highlighting.

Smoother music text, profile transitions and Invite/Bump animations. City and last-seen details take turns, long song titles repeat when no city is set, and profiles open faster.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/download/0.2.14/Firstlight-0.2.14.zip" length="42941732" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="HKbSEa30vR2Xx8aYasuxAAqLC9+x5E+ABVGTME7Ycz7Q9mSpRSZ0caTkNWFvlJWIQm2dnudGdVCDtzoyH5EoBw=="/>
